</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">ASRock Taichi RX 7900 XTX</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">PSU</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">Cooler Master V850 SFX Gold 850W white</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Storage</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">1 TB Lexar NM790 NVME PCIe Gen 4</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Extras</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">Eightwood low profile WiFi antenna, 18.0 cm double reverse PCIe Gen4 riser cable, 4 x Noctua NF-A6x25 PWM 60mm x 25mm fans (1 top exhaust, 3 lower intake)</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">Thermals</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4\">Ambient: <!-- -->23<!-- -->°C</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Part</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Idle</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Gaming</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Stress</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">cpu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>50<!-- -->–<!-- -->60<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>65<!-- -->–<!-- -->75<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>82<!-- -->–<!-- -->91<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">88w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">gpu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>24<!-- -->–<!-- -->26<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>40<!-- -->–<!-- -->50<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>61<!-- -->–<!-- -->66<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">489w</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">16,864</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">88<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">969</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,739</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">88<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,024</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">83<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">944</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">108</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">83<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">11,109</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">441.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">489w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">9,514</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">377.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">489w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,859</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">178.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">489w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">20,886</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">347.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">440w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">15,990</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">266.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">440w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">8,554</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">142.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">440w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">This is a low power CPU, but massive power-hungry GPU build in a very compact P-ATX case that is even smaller than the Fractal Ridge. The CPU cooler used is the ID-Cooling IS 50x v3 which can handle the Ryzen 7 7800X3D as the CPU is very power efficient. This 10.8L case is wider than expected and designed to fit SFX or SFX-L PSUs. The Cooler Master SFX 850W is compact yet provides enough power for the 7900 XTX which pulls almost 500W during stress testing compared to 90W from the CPU. Performance is excellent with normal 7800X3D temperatures during idle and moderate load. During Cinebench testing, temps maxed out at 91C with about 300 MHz throttle-back, which is expected for air cooling. The power button is located unusually at the bottom near the front. Major case considerations include: it&#x27;s a small niche maker with continuous stock issues, expensive ($179-189US plus $60US shipping from Croatia with 2-3 week delivery), and requires thermal/performance concessions typical of SFF builds. The case is good and flexible for mini-ITX, mATX, and full-size ATX motherboards but cannot fit E-ATX or BTX boards. Better suited for air-cooling; full-size 120mm AIO possible but limits GPU length. Can fit full-size ATX PSUs if length doesn&#x27;t exceed 140mm. Likely the smallest case fitting full-size ATX motherboards. Mini-ITX boards preferred due to PCIe riser blocking additional ports, easier mATX FPANEL access, potential mini-ITX CPU cooler conflicts with power cables, and GPU fitting constraints. Overall a solid and flexible compact case with notable availability and cost trade-offs.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">16,864</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:55%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->45<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">191.6</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">4<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">441.0<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-green\" style=\"width:80%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->20<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">0.9</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">21<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-10\"><div class=\"max-w-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm\">ComponentWatch</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Real-time PC component price tracking and community-verified SFF build data.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-14 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Prices</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">r/sffpc ↗</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> ComponentWatch. Prices update every 30 min via affiliate links.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint hidden sm:block\">Made for 